ext":"结果小木头还是老样子，就静静地看着他。","rawContent":"结果小木头还是老样子，就静静地看着他。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:17","timestamp":1786292243176,"roundId":"round_1786292192541_drbwkrq5a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":135864,"vts":1787504207791},{"id":1786279255954,"text":"孔雀有点生气，又有点着急。直到有一天，他发现，那块小木头在阳光下，好像泛起了一点点和他羽毛一样的光泽。","rawContent":"孔雀有点生气，又有点着急。直到有一天，他发现，那块小木头在阳光下，好像泛起了一点点和他羽毛一样的光泽。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:17","timestamp":1786292247679,"roundId":"round_1786292192541_drbwkrq5a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":135865,"vts":1787504212294},{"id":1786279255955,"text":"他才明白，小木头不是没反应，只是反应得特别慢特别慢。","rawContent":"他才明白，小木头不是没反应，只是反应得特别慢特别慢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:17","timestamp":1786292252418,"roundId":"round_1786292192541_drbwkrq5a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":135866,"vts":1787504217033},{"id":1786279255956,"text":"孔...雀突然就不想给别人看他的尾巴了，他就只想待在小木头身边，等她慢慢地、一点一点地，把他所有的颜色都收进自己的身体里。","rawContent":"孔...雀突然就不想给别人看他的尾巴了，他就只想待在小木头身边，等她慢慢地、一点一点地，把他所有的颜色都收进自己的身体里。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:17","timestamp":1786292257367,"roundId":"round_1786292192541_drbwkrq5a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":135867,"vts":1787504221982},{"id":1786279255957,"text":"故事讲完了。","rawContent":"故事讲完了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:17","timestamp":1786292259767,"roundId":"round_1786292192541_drbwkrq5a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":135868,"vts":1